rect number so this is one  way that they track that you've typed in  a credit card number that's valid  if you end up with a sum whose last  digit is not zero  then that means you probably typed in  your credit card number incorrectly  so it's a pretty neat magic trick and  someone who doesn't know that this is  encoded in the magic in the credit card  number is going to be surprised you knew  the last digit of this number is zero  thanks for watching this video please  subscribe to my channel i make videos on  math and game theory you can catch me on  my blog mindyourdecisions which you can  follow on facebook google plus and  patreon  you can catch me on social media at  preshtalwalker  and please check out my books i've  written a detailed description of each  one in the description for this video
 

